// [EVENT]: Added facts/scenarios to explicitly force Emergency entry/attempts for all edge cases (1, 2, >2, duplicate, non-admin).
// [EVENT]: Strengthened assertions so Emergency entry is possible if and only if exactly 2 distinct emAdmins act, and forbidden otherwise.
// [EVENT]: Added fact ensuring needsCredentialUpdate is set only in first Normal after Emergency, empty otherwise in Normal and always empty in Emergency.
// [EVENT]: Rewrote scenario predicates to demonstrate and check all negative edge cases per requirements; no more vacuity.
// [EVENT]: Removed all implication-based assertions that could be vacuous; replaced with explicit existential/negative forms.
// [LESSON]: Alloy set semantics mean "duplicate" can't occur in emAdmins, so cardinality <2 is used to model it; #emAdmins > 2 for over-count.
// [LESSON]: Can't restrict subset signature scope in run/check; must encode admin count/role in scenario predicates.
